See how we made AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production.

## Summary
The article describes Duolingo's development of an agent platform that simplifies the building, running, and improvement of AI agents in production. It highlights how the platform makes production-ready agents the default standard for deployment.

## Key Points
- Duolingo created a platform to streamline the development and deployment of AI agents.
- The platform emphasizes making AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production environments.
- The goal is to set production-ready AI agents as a standard for reliability and scalability.


